PN,31706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786027701
OL,3,CDiscarded SpaceX rocket set to
OL,4,Cunintentionally smash into the moon
OL,6,F"Part of the reason for our interest
OL,7,Fin this event is to figure out how
OL,8,Fmuch of a hazard debris impacts pose
OL,9,Fto future astronauts," he added in an
OL,10,Femail.
OL,12,FFernando anticipates an impact crater
OL,13,Fnearly 27 metres across and five
OL,14,Fmetres deep, too small to see from
OL,15,FEarth but visible to spacecraft.
OL,17,FBefore and after shots of the event
OL,18,Fwill be captured by NASA's Lunar
OL,19,FReconnaissance Orbiter and South
OL,20,FKorea's Danuri lunar orbiter.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
