PN,31708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786027701
OL,3,CDiscarded SpaceX rocket set to
OL,4,Cunintentionally smash into the moon
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FScientists observe orbit crashes for
OL,12,Ftheir research. NASA hurled rocket
OL,13,Fsections and lunar modules into the
OL,14,Fmoon during the Apollo era for seismic
OL,15,Fmeasurements.
OL,17,FDecades later, in 2009, NASA
OL,18,Fintentionally crashed its LCROSS
OL,19,Fspacecraft and upper stage in search
OL,20,Fof ice near the lunar south pole.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
