FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786027701
OL,3,CDiscarded SpaceX rocket set to
OL,4,Cunintentionally smash into the moon
OL,6,FWith the moon as the new travel hot
OL,7,Fspot, scientists said it's crucial to
OL,8,Fimprove debris monitoring and traffic
OL,9,Fcontrol before packs of robots and
OL,10,Fastronauts arrive.
OL,12,FThe United States and China are racing
OL,13,Fto land astronauts on the moon in the
OL,14,Fnext few years.
OL,16,FElon Musk's SpaceX and Jeff Bezos'
OL,17,FBlue Origin are racing to provide the
OL,18,Flander for NASA's yet-to-be-named
OL,19,Fmoonwalkers of Artemis IV, who will
OL,20,Fsucceed the 12 Apollo astronauts who
OL,21,Fstrolled the lunar surface.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
