FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786027701
OL,3,CDiscarded SpaceX rocket set to
OL,4,Cunintentionally smash into the moon
OL,6,FRetired astrophysicist Jonathan
OL,7,FMcDowell said although this impact is
OL,8,Fnot a problem, "in a future where
OL,9,Fthere are long-term bases on the moon,
OL,10,Fsimilar impacts would be an issue,"
OL,11,Fand we should not leave rockets in
OL,12,F"chaotic orbits of this kind".
